SUMMARY:Tkaronto Open IV
DESCRIPTION:Join us at Union Station’s West Wing for Tkaronto Open IV\, a special gathering celebrating Indigenous culture through a Pow Wow-style dance competition featuring Indigenous Women’s Jingle Dress dancers. \nExperience an afternoon of powerful performances\, cultural celebration\, and high-level competition in the heart of Toronto. \nFree admission. Doors open at 11:00 AM\, with the competition beginning at 1:00 PM. \nFor more information and contestant registration\, please visit the link below: \nhttps://www.ffdnorth.com/tkaronto-open \n 
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/tkaronto-open-iv/
LOCATION:West Wing\, 65 Front Street West\, Toronto\, ON\, M5R 1V9\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Dance,Live Performance
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://torontounion.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/sssssss-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
