SUMMARY:FALL’IN: A Dance Battle
DESCRIPTION:Introducing Fall for Dance North’s inaugural street dance battle at Union Station. \nFALL’IN: A Dance Battle brings together freestyle dancers for an all-styles\, one-on-one showdown\, featuring Hip Hop\, R&B\, Funk\, House\, Disco\, Soul and more. Conceived by Kwasi Obeng-Adjei\, this event transforms Union Station into a meeting point for dance\, where different styles\, rhythms and communities come together in the circle. \nWatch the battles\, dance in the cypher\, enjoy audience giveaways\, and experience an exciting judges showcase. \nFREE EVENT — OPEN TO THE PUBLIC \nCo-presented by Union and Fall for Dance North.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/fallin-a-dance-battle/
LOCATION:West Wing\, 65 Front Street West\, Toronto\, ON\, M5R 1V9\, Canada
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://torontounion.ca/wp-content/uploads/2019/05/westwing@2x-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
