SUMMARY:Soul and R&B Line Dancing
DESCRIPTION:Step into the rhythm and celebrate the joy of movement with a free\, all-levels Soul and R&B Line Dance party led by Rhea Daniels. \nFrom the Electric Slide to Boots on the Ground\, explore the rich history of line dancing and the ways these dances continue to evolve today. Whether you’re trying line dancing for the first time or you’re ready to show off your moves\, everyone is welcome. \nCome learn\, dance and enjoy an afternoon of music\, community and fun while celebrating Black music and its heritage with a distinctly Canadian twist. \nCo-presented by Union and Fall for Dance North.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/soul-and-rb-line-dancing/
LOCATION:West Wing\, 65 Front Street West\, Toronto\, ON\, M5R 1V9\, Canada
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://torontounion.ca/wp-content/uploads/2019/05/westwing@2x-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
